      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Elena accidentally hits someone with her car. She rushes out to check on the victim and realizes it is her rival, Chef Viktor. Let's listen closely to their exchange in Russian first, and then walk through each line together.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "elena",
      "t": "Виктор Петрович, вы живы?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "А?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "elena",
      "t": "Ой, вы простите меня.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "elena",
      "t": "Ради бога, простите.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "elena",
      "t": "Я вас просто не заметила.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
