      "t": "Осторожно.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Let's listen to their conversation.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "elena",
      "t": "Виктор Петрович, вы живы?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Viktor Petrovich, are you alive?' Rushing out of her car after the bump, Elena gasps and asks if Viktor is alive.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "А?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Huh?' Stunned on the pavement, Barinov can only let out a dazed 'huh?'.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "elena",
      "t": "Ой, вы простите меня.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Oh, please forgive me.' Elena apologizes profusely for hitting him.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "elena",
      "t": "Ради бога, простите.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'For God's sake, forgive me.' Shaken by the crash, she begs him for heaven's sake to forgive her.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "elena",
      "t": "Я вас просто не заметила.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I just didn't see you.' She explains that she simply did not see him stepping into the street.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Так вы расправляетесь с конкурентами.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'So this is how you deal with the competition.' Recognizing the chef from the rival restaurant next door, Viktor jokes that this is how she takes out the competition. Then Elena replies.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "elena",
      "t": "Дайте, я вас приподниму.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Here, let me help you up.' Elena reaches down and offers to help him to his feet.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "elena",
      "t": "Поедем в больницу.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We will go to the hospital.' She insists on driving him straight to the hospital.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Мне больно.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It hurts.' In pain as he tries to stand on his leg, Viktor admits that it hurts. And Elena jumps in.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "elena",
      "t": "Надо ехать к врачу.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We need to go to the doctor.' Seeing him limp, Elena says they definitely need to see a doctor.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Ладно, поехали.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'All right, let's go.' Viktor gives in and agrees to ride with her.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "elena",
      "t": "Осторожно.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Careful.' Elena tells him to be careful as she helps him into the passenger seat. Now let's hear the whole thing once more.",
      "gap": 0.9
